This is bad.

305
00:18:30,880 --> 00:18:32,340
This island...

306
00:18:55,840 --> 00:18:56,670
Strange.

307
00:18:56,753 --> 00:18:58,960
Why do I get the sense that Nami needs me?

308
00:19:03,040 --> 00:19:05,917
To those who reside here
and call this island home,

309
00:19:06,000 --> 00:19:10,294
